            "content": "<p>The Brain & Energy Duo is designed to support <strong>focus</strong>, <strong>motivation</strong>, and <strong>sustained</strong> <strong>daily</strong> <strong>energy</strong>. Combining Rhodiola, Mucuna Pruriens, Lion’s Mane Mushroom, and essential B vitamins, this complementary blend helps support mental clarity, cognitive performance, and everyday vitality. Each vegan pack contains <strong>30 Dopamine Patches</strong> and <strong>30 Energy Patches</strong>, offering a simple, convenient alternative to pills and gummies.</p><h3></h3><p></p><p></p><p></p>",
